OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FOvernight rain will soon clear
OL,6,Ffrom southern areas to leave many
OL,7,Fparts with a dry, bright, though at
OL,8,Ftimes rather blustery day. The odd
OL,9,Flight shower is possible in the north
OL,10,Fand near the west coast, and generally
OL,11,Ffeeling fresher.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FThe odd shower is still
OL,14,Flikely overnight but for many it will
OL,15,Fbe dry with clear spells. The brisk
OL,16,Fwind will gradually ease, and turning
OL,17,Fchilly in some rural spots.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
