OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CSaturday:FAny showers should fade on
OL,6,FSaturday morning to leave plenty of
OL,7,Fdry and bright weather with gentle
OL,8,Fwinds. Some cloud arriving from the
OL,9,Fwest later though, and staying fresher.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FSome
OL,12,Fwarm sunshine on Sunday, although
OL,13,Fturning windy. Rain overnight, then
OL,14,Fsome sunshine on Monday. Further wet
OL,15,Fand windy weather arriving later,
OL,16,Ffollowed by sunshine and blustery
OL,17,Fshowers on Tuesday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
